{"pageProps":{"content":{"id":491,"title":"“Caminhada Rumos” em Teresina","shortDescription":"Capital do Piauí recebe gerentes do Itaú Cultural (IC) no dia 14 de setembro de 2023","slug":"caminhada-rumos-em-teresina","program":"rumos","content":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Na quinta-feira 14 de setembro, &agrave;s 18h, a <em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\">Caminhada Rumos</em> chega &agrave; capital do Piau&iacute;. Em Teresina, gerentes do Ita&uacute; Cultural (IC) conversam com artistas, produtores locais e interessados em geral para tirar d&uacute;vidas sobre o programa de fomento<em>&nbsp;</em><a href=\"https://www.itaucultural.org.br/rumos\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong><em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\">Rumos</em></strong></a></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><strong>Veja tamb&eacute;m:<br>&gt;&gt;<a href=\"https://rumositaucultural.org.br/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Inscri&ccedil;&otilde;es abertas at&eacute; 22 de setembro</a><br>&gt;&gt;<a href=\"https://www.itaucultural.org.br/rumos\">Calend&aacute;rio das Caminhadas por todo o Brasil</a></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Criado em 1997, o edital j&aacute; passou por v&aacute;rias transforma&ccedil;&otilde;es e, ao longo de sua exist&ecirc;ncia,<br>viabilizou<span style=\"background: white;\">&nbsp;in&uacute;meras </span>a&ccedil;&otilde;es art&iacute;sticas e culturais em todas as regi&otilde;es do pa&iacute;s. <a href=\"https://rumositaucultural.org.br/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>As inscri&ccedil;&otilde;es para a edi&ccedil;&atilde;o 2023-2024 do <em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\">Rumos</em> est&atilde;o abertas e podem ser feitas <em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\">on-line</em></strong></a>&nbsp;at&eacute; o pr&oacute;ximo dia 22 de setembro.<br style=\"mso-special-character: line-break;\"><!-- [if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br style=\"mso-special-character: line-break;\"><!--[endif]--></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal; background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: #222222; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">&nbsp;<div class=\"video-frame\"><iframe style=\"border: none; width: 500px; height: 326px;\" src=\"https://e.issuu.com/embed.html?d=folder_rumos&amp;u=itaucultural\" width=\"\" height=\"\" sandbox=\"allow-top-navigation allow-top-navigation-by-user-activation allow-downloads allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-modals allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox allow-forms\" allow=\"clipboard-write\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></div></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal; background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal; background: white;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">Caminhada Rumos</span></em></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-b